<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley cuts 3 gold stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan Stanley cuts 3 gold stocks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said Tuesday it downgraded shares in three gold mining companies.</p>
<p>-- Cut Newmont Mining Corp, TVX Gold Inc and Prime Resources Group Inc to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- On Monday, the price of gold fell to its lowest level since 1985.</p>
<p>-- Newmont Mining shares closed Monday at 35-7/16 and NYSE-listed shares in TVX closed at 4-5/8.  Prime Resources closed at C$9.40 on the Toronto Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
